-- The launch poster in plain English. The sentences are grouped by thing; their order does not matter.
Let there be a canvas called launch, 1080 by 1350.
Make the card #10131f, grainy 0.22.

Let there be a rectangle called photo, 1080 by 760, at 540 380.
Print @marilyn.jpg in the photo, duotone #1b1145 and #ff9a5a, focused at 0.5 0.2.

Let there be 40 circles called dot, 7 big, in a grid 8 by 5, 46 apart, from 70 70.
Make the dots white, 65% see-through.

Let there be a rectangle called glass, 900 by 330, corners 40, at 540 760.
Make the glass frosted, white, 86% see-through.
Give the glass a shadow, 20 down, blur 40, 55% opacity.
Give the glass an outline in #ffffff, 2 wide, 45% opacity.

Write "LAUNCH DAY" called title in Lilita One, at 540 720, fit 780.
Write "Friday 20 November · doors at seven" called when in Jost, at 540 850, size 40.
Make the title and the when line up on the left.
Make the title a gradient from #fff3d6 to #ff9a5a, angled 90.
Give the title an outline in #1b1145, 8 wide.
Make the when white.

Let there be a bubble called tag, 300 by 130, corners 36, at 850 150.
Write "NEW!" called new in Lilita One, at 850 172, size 70, turned -6.
Make the tag #ff5d5d, shadowed.
Make the new white.

Let there be a hexagon called one, 70 big, corners 10, at 200 1090.
Let there be a heart called two, 130 big, at 420 1100.
Let there be a diamond called three, 70 big, at 700 1080.
Let there be an arrow called four, 170 by 110, at 900 1120.
Make the one, the two, the three and the four line up on the middle.
Make the one, the two, the three and the four evenly spaced horizontally.
Make the one #5ad1c9.
Make the two #ff5d8f.
Make the three #ffd166.
Make the four #8f7bff.
Give the one, the two, the three and the four an inner shadow, 6 down, blur 10, 45% opacity.

Write "Things are made, given and moved in plain sentences, and they arrange themselves." called body in Jost, at 540 1255, size 30, 880 wide, leading 1.3.
Make the body #c9cede.
